# INVWIN6.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the location
# tree.  Locations > Browse locations opens it in place of the item
# list, the frame titled for it; ENTER shows a location's contents,
# whose ESC goes back to the tree, that location selected; CTRL+E edits
# one, the focus on its name, and OK saves it, the tree fetched again
# from its start showing the change, the location saved selected and
# the note of the save on the status bar; the frame maximized and
# restored keeps the tree; ESC goes back to the item list, and a browse
# entry of the Items menu leaves the tree too; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN6.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-L B
S LOCS
# Shelf A1's contents, and ESC back
K DOWN ENTER
S CONTENTS
K ESC
S LOCSBACK
# Box B2 renamed and saved
K DOWN CTRL-E
S EDIT
T Bin B2
S TYPED
K ENTER
S SAVED
# maximized and restored with the first row selected, the list stays
# the location tree (whether a size opens it again depends on the
# screen)
K HOME ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-SPACE R
S RESTORE
K ESC
S BACK
K ALT-L B ALT-I M
S BYMFR
K ALT-F X
